Tech Shop Online is an up-and-coming e-commerce platform that is ready to launch.
They are aiming for a modern and minimalistic webpage to introduce their brand to the customers. 
The company wants to give potential customers a sense of their mission, contact options, and a quick overview of their servicesthrough this basic HTML webpage. 
This webpage will be one of the first things visitors will see when they visit the website, so it's important to include clear and structured information.
You are hired by Tech Shop Online, a fictional e-commerce website that sells electronic gadgets. 
They need a basic HTML page to introduce the online store to new visitors. 
The page should include a store name, a mission statement, and a footer with contact information. Your task is to create the page using the necessary HTML elements.

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Tech Shop Online</title>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Store Name -->
    <h1>Tech Shop Online</h1>

    <!-- Mission Statement -->
    <h2>Our Mission</h2>
    <p>Our mission is to provide affordable, high-quality electronics to customers around the world.</p>

    <!-- Why Choose Us -->
    <h2>Why Choose Us?</h2>
    <p>At Tech Shop Online, we offer top-tier electronic gadgets, unbeatable prices, and fast shipping to ensure you get the best technology hassle-free.</p>

    <!-- Product Description -->
    <p>We offer a range of premium laptops, including the latest models with high-speed processors and long-lasting batteries.</p>

    <!-- Contact Information -->
    <h3>Contact Information</h3>
    <p>We are committed to providing excellent customer service. Reach us at contact@techshop.com or call 1-800-123-4567.</p>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2025 Tech Shop Online. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
